<p>I always liked 2557, but this feels like an overreach of a format screw. It's essentially your standard &quot;but wait, there's more in the high-level classified stuff!&quot; and I can't say I like the idea of either Envelope Logistics becoming its own entity, or of the whole ESCP thing. And I mean, it's just a thing what predicts bad stuff happening, there's a lot of that already.</p>

